  "content_id": "16136181",
  "title": "Paybis Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Why Was My Paybis Transaction Declined? \nIf your cryptocurrency transaction on Paybis has been declined, it may be due to security measure...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My Paybis Transaction Declined? </b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your cryptocurrency transaction on Paybis has been declined, it may be due to security measures designed to protect users and the platform.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Risk Concerns:</b> Transactions flagged as risky may be blocked — specifics are not disclosed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Some banks block crypto or treat it as a cash advance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Unauthorized Payments:</b> Report any unrecognized charges to Paybis support</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry after 24 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use an alternative payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank about crypto-related restrictions</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (including spam) for Paybis verification requests</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://paybis.com/contacts/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Paybis Support</b></a><b>: https://paybis.com/contacts/</b></p></li></ol>",
